{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2aa18cff-c379-8108-a400-b564755a93a9",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:23:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila T. Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin. My name is Leila Haddad. I am calling about the street light in front of my house. It goes on and off, on and off, all the night long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, flickering overnight. And where is that, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three hundred Narragansett Avenue. The light is on the pole just by my front walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three hundred Narragansett. Got it. Is it the whole night, or just certain hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole night. Even my smart thermostat is arguing with me, because the hallway is bright, then dark, then bright. It does not know what to think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's definitely noticeable. I'm writing down, flickering light, pole at three hundred Narragansett, going all night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Could you please send a crew to check the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for a crew to look at it. Is this number, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-one, good if they need you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you very much, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
